      "title": "File:Nine O'Clock Gun (Hudson's Bay) plaque 725 Granville Street Vancouver BC V7Y 1C6 Canada.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d2/Nine_O%27Clock_Gun_%28Hudson%27s_Bay%29_plaque_725_Granville_Street_Vancouver_BC_V7Y_1C6_Canada.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
